THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

Portions of this project are derived from claude-github-issue
(https://github.com/szmidtpiotr/claude-github-issue) by szmidtpiotr, which
declares the MIT License in its package.json.

That project has no LICENSE file and names no copyright year or holder beyond
the author field, so no verbatim copyright notice exists to reproduce here.
This notice is given in its place, identifying the work, its author and the
licence it declares.

What is derived from it:

  - the build configuration in vite.config.ts and tsconfig.json, and the
    build scripts in package.json;
  - the shape of the claudecodeui plugin entry point — the mount/unmount
    exports, the React context wrapping the host api object, and the
    injection of inlined CSS at mount;
  - the HTML5 drag-and-drop arrangement between card and column;
  - the pattern of installing a companion skill into the user's Claude Code
    skills directory from the plugin backend.

What is not: the entire data layer is original to this project. The upstream
plugin boards repository issues by label over the GitHub REST API; this one
boards GitHub Projects v2 items over GraphQL, which shares no code with it.
No component, stylesheet or service file was copied.
